* Slow RLC Series Circuit - Simulation Progress Feedback Test
* The transient is long enough for the status bar progress indicator, the
* warning badge and the simulation output panel to be observed while the run
* is in flight; the floating capacitor makes Xyce report a warning
V1 IN 0 PULSE(0 5 0 1n 1n 1m 2m)
R1 IN 0 100
L1 IN N2 10mH
C1 N2 0 1uF
C3 FLOAT 0 100n

.PREPROCESS REPLACEGROUND TRUE
.TRAN 1u 1 0
.PRINT TRAN FORMAT=RAW V(IN) V(N2)

.END